### 1. List all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. List books filtered by author
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=Bloch
Accept: application/json

### 3. List books with pagination (Variant 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=2
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get book by id (found - 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get book by id (not found - 404 ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/problem+json

### 6. Create book (success - 201 + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design Patterns",
  "author": "Erich Gamma",
  "year": 1994,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### 7. Create book with invalid body (blank title - 400 ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Erich Gamma",
  "year": 1994,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### 8. Create book with duplicate title (conflict - 409 ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### 9. Update existing book (200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java 3rd Edition",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018,
  "genre": "TECHNOLOGY"
}

### 10. Delete book (first attempt - 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 11. Delete same book again (idempotency check - 404 Not Found ProblemDetail)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 12. OpenAPI specification document
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs

### 13. Swagger UI page
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
